{
  "$comment": [
    "Source configuration for `npm run seed`.",
    "",
    "Each entry writes data/amenities/<category>.json. Entries marked",
    "\"verified\": false have a source identifier that has NOT been confirmed",
    "against the live portal — if the seed reports one as failed, open the",
    "dataset on data.gov.sg and paste the ID from its URL",
    "(https://data.gov.sg/datasets/<id>/view) into \"datasetId\".",
    "",
    "kinds:",
    "  lta-datamall   - LTA DataMall REST endpoint. Needs LTA_ACCOUNT_KEY.",
    "  ckan-postal    - data.gov.sg datastore rows geocoded by postal code.",
    "  onemap-theme   - OneMap Themes API. Needs ONEMAP_EMAIL / ONEMAP_PASSWORD.",
    "  geojson-dataset- data.gov.sg dataset download (GeoJSON).",
    "  local-geojson  - a .geojson file you downloaded yourself, under data/raw/."
  ],
